   00001| # The CI speed rule (PR #1188), enforced by `scripts/check-ci-speed.mjs`
   00002| # (`data/meta/ci-gates/check-ci-speed.lino`). Documented in docs/ci-cd/speed.md.
   00003| #
   00004| # - No job or step runs longer than limit-minutes; target-minutes is the aim.
   00005| #   Every job declares a timeout-minutes at or under the limit, and no job's
   00006| #   measured maximum in data/meta/ci-durations.lino is above it.
   00007| # - Long work starts first. A job whose measured median is at or above
   00008| #   long-job-minutes waits only on jobs whose outputs, results or artifacts it
   00009| #   uses; test shards are planned longest-first by shard-planner from recorded
   00010| #   durations, and every sharded-suite runs through it.
   00011| # - Sharding loses nothing: the plan puts every listed test in exactly one shard.
   00012| #
   00013| # A job that cannot meet the limit yet is an over-limit-job under its workflow,
   00014| # with the cap it may keep and the reason. The list only shrinks: an entry whose
   00015| # job meets the limit again, or no longer exists, fails the gate until removed.
   00016| ci-speed
   00017|   issue 1188
   00018|   limit-minutes 30
   00019|   target-minutes 15
   00020|   long-job-minutes 10
   00021|   durations "data/meta/ci-durations.lino"
   00022|   test-durations "data/meta/test-durations.lino"
   00023|   javascript-test-durations "data/meta/javascript-test-durations.lino"
   00024|   playwright-test-durations "data/meta/playwright-test-durations.lino"
   00025|   shard-planner "scripts/plan-test-shards.mjs"
   00026|   sharded-suite "scripts/run-prebuilt-tests.sh"
   00027|   sharded-suite "scripts/run-coverage-shard.sh"
   00028|   sharded-suite ".github/workflows/release.yml"
   00029|   sharded-suite ".github/workflows/layered-ci.yml"
   00030|   sharded-suite ".github/workflows/e2e-local.yml"
   00031|   workflow ".github/workflows/container-images.yml"
   00032|     over-limit-job build
   00033|       timeout-minutes 90
   00034|       reason "Dispatch and workflow_call only, never on a pull request: one multi-architecture image build per Dockerfile, arm64 under emulation, with a 45-minute build step. To meet 30: build each architecture on its own native runner."
   00035|   workflow ".github/workflows/coverage.yml"
   00036|     over-limit-job coverage-build
   00037|       timeout-minutes 40
   00038|       reason "One instrumented build of every test target, measured 20.5 minutes at most (median 18.1); its 1500s budget needs the 40-minute cap under the 70% share rule (issue #1081). To meet 30: build the unit, integration and source harnesses in parallel jobs."
   00039|   workflow ".github/workflows/dependencies-latest.yml"
   00040|     over-limit-job update
   00041|       timeout-minutes 90
   00042|       reason "Weekly schedule and dispatch only: updates every dependency, then builds and tests the whole crate in one job."
   00043|   workflow ".github/workflows/desktop-release.yml"
   00044|     over-limit-job build
   00045|       timeout-minutes 50
   00046|       reason "Measured 41.3 minutes at most (macos-x64; windows-arm64 37.6): one release build plus Electron packaging per operating system, which one machine has to do. Pull requests run it only when desktop, vscode or Rust sources change. To meet 30: package a release binary built once per target."
   00047|     over-limit-job cli
   00048|       timeout-minutes 50
   00049|       reason "Measured 34.4 minutes at most (cli-macos-x64): one cold release build per target on the slowest runner. To meet 30: share the release build with the desktop job for the same target."
   00050|   workflow ".github/workflows/external-benchmarks.yml"
   00051|     over-limit-job external-benchmarks
   00052|       timeout-minutes 90
   00053|       reason "Schedule and dispatch only (skipped on pull requests, which run the ratchet): runs the upstream suites, 21.2 minutes at most on main. To meet 30: run the sharded upstream-shard path on schedule too."
   00054|     over-limit-job upstream-shard
   00055|       timeout-minutes 45
   00056|       reason "Dispatch with a shard size only: one window of the upstream suites. To meet 30: size the windows from measured durations."
   00057|   workflow ".github/workflows/issue-1028-agent-ladder.yml"
   00058|     over-limit-job ladder
   00059|       timeout-minutes 135
   00060|       reason "The weekly all corpus is now 31 parallel primary legs (16 leaf pairs and 15 requirement nodes), followed by 16 artifact-fed single-composite legs. Existing leaf-pair measurements max19.0 minutes; cold all-mode requirement timings remain unmeasured. Keep this generous primary backstop until every new leg is actually below30; plan30 + primary135 + leaf-join15 + composites30 + compare15 preserves the225-minute static DAG ceiling."
   00061|   workflow ".github/workflows/macos-core-tests.yml"
   00062|     over-limit-job build-archive
   00063|       timeout-minutes 55
   00064|       reason "Switched off while non-Linux CI is off (issue #1111): a cold build of the macOS test archive. To meet 30: build the archive from a shared compiler cache on the Linux build job's schedule."
   00065|   workflow ".github/workflows/release.yml"
   00066|     over-limit-job auto-release
   00067|       timeout-minutes 90
   00068|       reason "Push to main only: builds and publishes the Docker images and the GitHub release in one job; issue #977 requires at least 60 minutes, because at 30 the job was killed mid-build before the release step."
   00069|     over-limit-job manual-release
   00070|       timeout-minutes 90
   00071|       reason "Dispatch only: the auto-release job's work on demand, under the same issue #977 floor of 60 minutes."
   00072| 
   
   (End of file - total 72 lines)
